  "id": "symbolic-reward",
  "term": "symbolic reward",
  "definition": "A symbolic reward is positive feedback delivered through signs or words rather than money or other material gain, such as being told a response is correct. In learning tasks, it functions as a less-salient motivational signal that can reinforce a choice or action.",
